          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám baalaadae Aako dakós gu malé tlees as mukós kudá' meet baraá Ashuru nguwa ki/isi, nee kuduú baraá Misri, nee baraá Patrosi, nee oo baraá Kushi, nee oo baraá Elamu, nee oo baraá Babuloni, nee oo baraá Hama'ati, nee kudaá baraá ayeemoodaá afaá tlawi.",
          "type": "text",
